      "source": [
        "# 3D Generation Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "`code/main.py` implements a toy 2D \"Gaussian splatting\" fit: represent a synthetic target image (a smooth gradient) as a sum of 2D Gaussian splats. Optimize positions, colors, and covariances by gradient descent to match the target. You see the two core operations: forward render (splat + alpha-composite) and fit by gradient descent."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: 2D Gaussian splat"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def gaussian_at(x, y, gaussian):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    px, py = gaussian[\"pos\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    sigma = gaussian[\"sigma\"]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    d2 = (x - px) ** 2 + (y - py) ** 2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return math.exp(-d2 / (2 * sigma * sigma))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: render by summing splats"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "def render(image_size, gaussians):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    img = [[0.0] * image_size for _ in range(image_size)]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for g in gaussians:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        for y in range(image_size):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            for x in range(image_size):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "                img[y][x] += g[\"color\"] * gaussian_at(x, y, g)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return img"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Real 3D Gaussian splatting sorts Gaussians by depth and alpha-composites in order. Our 2D toy just sums."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: fit by gradient descent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "for step in range(steps):"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    pred = render(size, gaussians)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    loss = mse(pred, target)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    gradients = compute_grads(pred, target, gaussians)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    update(gaussians, gradients, lr)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
